{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.Universal","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.Universal","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.Datum","lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.Interpret","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Linear.LinearFunctor"],"declarations":24,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_unique","kind":"theorem","line":236,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L236-L252","doc":"**Uniqueness.** An `R`-linear functor out of `OS(z, t)` that agrees with `lift D` on objects\nand on every layer is `lift D`. Together with `lift_layer`, the lift is determined by the images\n`genHom D g` of the four generators. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_layer","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_layer","kind":"theorem","line":227,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L227-L234","doc":"The lift of a layer: the interpreted generator, whiskered through the canonical\nisomorphisms `μ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.hom_induction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.hom_induction","kind":"theorem","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L196-L225","doc":"**Generation.** A property of morphisms of `OS` closed under zero, sums, scalars, composition\nand transport along equalities of objects, and holding on every layer, holds on every morphism. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.homMk_one_eq_eqToHom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.homMk_one_eq_eqToHom","kind":"theorem","line":192,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L192-L194","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.layer_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.layer_eq","kind":"theorem","line":184,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L184-L190","doc":"A layer is a generator whiskered by identities. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.layer","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.layer","kind":"def","line":180,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L180-L182","doc":"The layer `s` as a morphism of `OS`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_evaluation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_evaluation","kind":"theorem","line":174,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L174-L176","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_coevaluation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_coevaluation","kind":"theorem","line":170,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L170-L172","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_T","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_T","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L167-L168","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_S","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_S","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L164-L165","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_gen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_gen","kind":"theorem","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L157-L162","doc":"The lift of a generator is its interpretation `genHom D g`: `S`, `T`, the cup and the cap of\n`D`, conjugated by the right unitors `obj [x] = col x ⊗ 𝟙 ≅ col x`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.instMonoidalOSCatLift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.instMonoidalOSCatLift","kind":"instance","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L153-L153","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.liftCoreMonoidal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.liftCoreMonoidal","kind":"def","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L132-L151","doc":"The lift is a monoidal functor, with tensorator the canonical isomorphism\n`obj a ⊗ obj b ≅ obj (a ++ b)` and identity unitor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_whiskerLeft","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_whiskerLeft","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L116-L130","doc":"The lift of a left whiskering. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_whiskerRight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_whiskerRight","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L107-L114","doc":"The lift of a right whiskering. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_canon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.lift_canon","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L101-L105","doc":"The lift of a canonical morphism is the transport along the equality of words. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.interp_congr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.interp_congr","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L95-L99","doc":"Transport of the interpretation along equalities of words. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.instLinearOSCatLift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.instLinearOSCatLift","kind":"instance","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Universal.lean#L92-L93","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.instAdditiveOSCatLift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.instAdditiveOSCatLift","kind":"instance","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/734